      "source_en": "The Green Helmet and Other Poems: first published in 1910, including the play The\nGreen Helmet. The order and contents here first established in Responsibilities\n(1916).\n 91: Yeats commented that \"a few days ago I dreamed that I was steering a very\ngay and elaborate ship upon narrow water with many people upon its banks,\nand that there was a figure upon a bed in the middle of the ship. The people\nwere pointing to the figure and questioning, and in my dream I sang verses",
